# Empty Memories (jeuno 70): Ru'Lude Gardens' Harith (no script; default event 111; no other container). A level 75
# Warrior with 20000 gil, CoP The Mothercrystals current (a GM, before login), holding three Recollections of Pain, one
# each of Fear, Guilt, Suffering, Anxiety and Animosity, and a Bird Feather.
# Available: the trade while only available, the accepted state's valid trade (a Recollection of Pain and 2000 gil):
# no onTrade in section 1: nothing. 113, option 0: nothing; option 2: nothing; option 1: begun.
# Accepted: 114. Trades of the Recollection of Pain (wants 2000 gil): no gil: 108 (2000); 1999 gil: 108; 2001 gil: 108;
# a Bird Feather alone (no recollection): nil (nothing); two Pains and 2000 gil: hasItemQty(item, 1) wants exactly one:
# nil (nothing); a Pain, the Bird Feather and 2000 gil (the exact trade plus an extra item): 109; finished: the Bottle of
# Hysteroanima, the Pain taken (confirmItem(item, 1)), the feather and the trade's gil not taken (unconfirmed), 2000 gil
# taken by delGil, fame +5 in San d'Oria, Bastok and Windurst (accepted), completed. The trades with gil offer it first
# (trade slot 0, where trade:getGil() reads it).
# Completed: 114; a Pain and 2000 gil: 109, finished: the Hysteroanima is Rare and held: not given: nothing (nothing
# taken, no gil). The Recollection of Suffering (no gil wanted) with 2000 gil and a full bag (fill-inventory): 110 (the
# gil not read); the finish gives nothing (nothing taken); again with a free bag: the Hamayumi, the Suffering taken, no
# gil taken, no fame (completed), completed again. Fear with 1999 / 2001 gil: 108 (2000); with 2000: 109: the Bottle of
# Psychoanima, 2000 gil taken. Guilt with 1999 / 2001: 108; with 2000: 109: the Bottle of Terroanima, 2000 gil taken.
# Anxiety: 110: the Stone Gorget. Animosity: 110: the Dia Wand.
# #available takes the check's mission operands, #two_recollections the reward table's pairs() order, #mid_event the
# finishes outside their states.
lists RuludeGardens/Harith/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Harith/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/113 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/109 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/110
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=-4.3,2,132.5 job=WAR lvl=75 gil=20000
mission Cop TheMothercrystals current
item RecollectionOfPain x3
item RecollectionOfFear
item RecollectionOfGuilt
item RecollectionOfSuffering
item RecollectionOfAnxiety
item RecollectionOfAnimosity
item BirdFeather
login
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfPain x1  # available: no onTrade: nothing
trigger Harith                          # available, CoP The Mothercrystals: 113
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Harith                          # 113
finish option=2                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Harith                          # 113
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Harith                          # accepted: 114
finish
trade Harith RecollectionOfPain x1      # no gil: 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith gil=1999 RecollectionOfPain x1  # 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith gil=2001 RecollectionOfPain x1  # 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith BirdFeather x1             # no recollection: nil; nothing
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfPain x2  # two Pains: hasItemQty(item, 1) is exact: no row matches: nil; nothing
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfPain x1 BirdFeather x1  # the exact trade plus an extra item: 109; the Pain confirmed
finish                                  # the Bottle of Hysteroanima; the Pain taken, the feather and the trade's gil kept, 2000 gil taken (delGil); fame +5 x3; completed
trigger Harith                          # completed: 114
finish
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfPain x1  # 109
finish                                  # the Hysteroanima held (Rare): not given: nothing
fill-inventory
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfSuffering x1  # 110 (no gil wanted)
finish                                  # the Hamayumi cannot be given: nothing
free-inventory
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfSuffering x1  # 110
finish                                  # the Hamayumi; the Suffering taken; no gil taken; no fame; completed again
trade Harith gil=1999 RecollectionOfFear x1  # 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith gil=2001 RecollectionOfFear x1  # 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfFear x1  # 109
finish                                  # the Bottle of Psychoanima; 2000 gil taken
trade Harith gil=1999 RecollectionOfGuilt x1  # 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith gil=2001 RecollectionOfGuilt x1  # 108 (2000)
finish
trade Harith gil=2000 RecollectionOfGuilt x1  # 109
finish                                  # the Bottle of Terroanima; 2000 gil taken
trade Harith RecollectionOfAnxiety x1   # 110
finish                                  # the Stone Gorget
trade Harith RecollectionOfAnimosity x1 # 110
finish                                  # the Dia Wand
